114	/// Execute one tool call through the shared authorize -> invoke -> redact
115	/// pipeline ([`execute_tool_call`]) and return its outcome.
116	///
117	/// SDK-free. An unknown tool name or a denied/failed call is folded into
118	/// `outcome.result`'s `Err` string per [`execute_tool_call`]'s contract —
119	/// this function never panics and never returns an `Err` of its own. The
120	/// `AgentEvent::PermissionDenied` event `execute_tool_call` may also produce
